{
  "version": 1,
  "mappingRevision": 4,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Low tide pulls a silver line away.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "What little letter-clues did the shoreline save?",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Anchor — that's A. Low tide shows the sand | heavy metal drops to hold a boat close at hand.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Spot B: Boat! A floating little carrier rocking on the blue.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "C brings Coral. Branches lace | little reef rooms make a living space.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "What does D bring? Dock! The shoreline reaches out | a long platform where boats come close.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "E — Estuary. River meets the tide | fresh and salty waters mix side by side.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Flipper — that's F. A broad swimming limb sweeps water back to help an animal through.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Spot G: Gull! White wings lean into coastal wind and circle wide.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "H brings Harbor—a calmer pocket where the boats can rest in blue.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "What does I bring? Isopod! Under shoreline cover, a hard segmented body carries many little legs underneath.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "J — Jellyfish. Soft bell drifting, trailing tentacles behind.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Kelp — that's K. Below the tide | long brown-green ribbons sway side to side.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Spot L: Lagoon! Shallow water set apart from open sea—a quiet place to find.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-3-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-3",
      "text": "Tide rolls out—look what we found!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-3-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-3",
      "text": "Letter treasures all around!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "M brings Manatee. Slow with ease | paddle flippers sweep warm rivers and seas.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "What does N bring? Narwhal! Arctic whale; one spiral tusk can point ahead as it goes.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "O — Oyster. Shell shuts well | rough two-part home where tidal waters swell.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Pufferfish — that's P. It can make its body rounder when a danger shows.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Spot Q: Quahog! Under sand | hard clam shell tucked close at hand.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "R brings Reef—a rocky or coral home with cracks where little animals hide.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "What does S bring? Seahorse! Hold a strand | curled tail grips the plant like a hand.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "T — Turtle. Hard shell on its back; steady strokes carry it through the tide.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Urchin — that's U. Round on the ground | stiff sea spines point all around.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Spot V: Vessel! Beyond the beach line, a boat or ship travels over open water.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "W brings Whale. Up, then down | giant mammal breathes at the surface, then turns around.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "What does X bring? Xanthid Crab! Rounded shell and walking legs move among shore rocks.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Y — Yellowfin Tuna. Fins flash into view | yellow-tinted swimmer racing through blue.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Zooplankton — that's Z. Too tiny to choose a path | moving water carries the drifters along.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Tide rolls out—look what we found!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Letter treasures all around!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-A",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Spot A ... Anchor! Point down slowly, like an anchor dropping.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-B",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "B? ... Boat! Row two slow strokes.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-C",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Find C ... Coral! Spread fingers like reef branches.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-D",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "D ... Dock! Stretch one arm straight like a dock.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-E",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Spot E ... Estuary! Bring two hands together like waters meeting.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-F",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "F? ... Flipper! Sweep one hand like a flipper.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-G",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Find G ... Gull! Spread arms gently like wings.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-H",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "H ... Harbor! Curve both hands into a safe little bay.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-I",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Spot I ... Isopod! Walk fingertips in a tiny row.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-J",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "J? ... Jellyfish! Pulse your fingers softly like a drifting bell.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-K",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Find K ... Kelp! Sway one hand like a long ribbon.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-L",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "L ... Lagoon! Make a quiet bowl shape with both hands.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-3-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-3",
      "text": "Tide rolls out—look what we found!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-3-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-3",
      "text": "Letter treasures all around!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-M",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Spot M ... Manatee! Push both hands slowly through the water.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-N",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "N? ... Narwhal! Point one finger forward like a tusk, then glide.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-O",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Find O ... Oyster! Close two hands like a shell.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-P",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "P ... Pufferfish! Make a small round shape with your hands.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Q",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Spot Q ... Quahog! Close both palms like a clam shell.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-R",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "R? ... Reef! Make a little hiding arch with your hands.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-S",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Find S ... Seahorse! Curl one finger like a seahorse tail.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-T",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "T ... Turtle! Make a shell shape with both hands.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-U",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Spot U ... Urchin! Spread fingers into a round spiky shape.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-V",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "V? ... Vessel! Rock both hands gently like a boat.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-W",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Find W ... Whale! Glide both hands wide, then lift for a breath.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-X",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "X ... Xanthid Crab! Wiggle fingers sideways like a small crab.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Y",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Spot Y ... Yellowfin Tuna! Make one smooth, speedy fish-swim.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Z",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Z? ... Zooplankton! Let fingertips drift slowly with the current.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Tide rolls out—look what we found!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Letter treasures all around!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-1",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "Tide rolls in and smooths the sand.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-2",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "Our letter treasures stay in hand.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    }
  ]
}
